    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933060/extras/685116ab9bd5ca9c52ff2a66f317095f.avif?t=1724073446\" /></div><br><br><strong>There is no truer love than that of a dad for his daughter, and of a daughter for her daddy.<br>Glimpse this wonderful relationship by playing these six super-cute scenes in this puzzle game about the daily life of fatherhood.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933060/extras/c174832b11b63754e58319e4523bf288.avif?t=1724073446\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play 6 illustrated scenes in a very fun puzzle game<br></li><li>5 difficulty levels, for casual and hardcore gamers<br></li><li>Secret mini-games, unlocked while you playing<br></li><li>Beautiful characters, based on real life familyl<br></li><li>Steam Achievements</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933060/extras/685116ab9bd5ca9c52ff2a66f317095f.avif?t=1724073446\" /></div><br><br><strong>There is no truer love than that of a dad for his daughter, and of a daughter for her daddy.<br>Glimpse this wonderful relationship by playing these six super-cute scenes in this puzzle game about the daily life of fatherhood.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933060/extras/c174832b11b63754e58319e4523bf288.avif?t=1724073446\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play 6 illustrated scenes in a very fun puzzle game<br></li><li>5 difficulty levels, for casual and hardcore gamers<br></li><li>Secret mini-games, unlocked while you playing<br></li><li>Beautiful characters, based on real life familyl<br></li><li>Steam Achievements</li></ul>",
